@startuml sequence_initial_render
!theme plain
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center

title Initial Render

actor User
participant ReviewGoalHistoryTileComponent as Comp
participant ReviewGoalHistoryController as Ctrl
participant TileContext as Ctx
participant GoalProgressService as Svc
participant "Commitments.Api" as Api

User -> Comp: tile mounts
Comp -> Ctrl: ngOnInit
Ctrl -> Ctx: selectedReviewDate()
Ctx --> Ctrl: '2026-04-12'
par
    Ctrl -> Svc: getAt(goalId, eod)
    Svc -> Api: GET /at?asOf=2026-04-12T23:59:59Z
    Api --> Svc: GoalProgressDto
    Svc --> Ctrl: historical
also
    Ctrl -> Svc: getCurrent(goalId)
    Svc -> Api: GET /current
    Api --> Svc: GoalProgressDto
    Svc --> Ctrl: today
end
Comp --> User: renders metric, badge, delta

@enduml
